# Excel Report Column Updates

Update the existing Excel report export only as specified below. Do not change any underlying business logic, data retrieval, calculations, or UI behavior.

## 1. Commit Violations Tab

### Keep
- Component
- Commit Message
- Story
- Author
- Commit Lifecycle
- Commit Story Fixed Version
- Violation Category
- Violation Description
- Suggested Resolution

### Remove
- Commit Date
- Compliance Status
- Evaluation Status
- Override Status
- Override Reason

### Column order
Place **Commit Story Fixed Version** immediately before **Violation Category**.

Use the existing `evaluated_fix_version` value for **Commit Story Fixed Version**.

---

