## 5. Deployment Tabs

Apply the following column structure consistently to **all deployment sections**:

- Test 3
- Test 4
- Stage
- Production
- East-West
- Any other existing deployment environment sections

### Keep
- Component
- Namespace
- Git Commit
- Latest Release Commit
- Release Branch / GitHub Branch
- Deployment Status
- Teams
- Stories
- Validation Message

### Remove
- Deployment Name
- Active Color
- Image Tag
- Build Number
- Commits Behind
- Deployment Timestamp

Do **not** remove:
- Git Commit
- Latest Release Commit
- Release Branch / GitHub Branch

### Deployment Status

Keep the existing **Deployment Status** column.

Do not introduce or retain duplicate/redundant status columns unnecessarily. If `Validation Status` duplicates the same information as `Deployment Status`, use the existing `Deployment Status` as the single exported status field.

