## Acceptance Criteria

1. Excel export contains exactly the requested columns for each tab.
2. Column ordering follows the requirements above.
3. `evaluated_fix_version` is exported as **Commit Story Fixed Version**.
4. Commit Lifecycle is included in both commit-related tabs.
5. Removed columns must no longer appear in the generated Excel file.
6. Story Status remains unchanged.
7. Branch Cut Validation excludes invalid-component data and the specified columns.
8. All deployment environment tabs follow the same requested column structure.
9. Existing data retrieval and business logic must remain unchanged.
10. Do not introduce unrelated changes or refactoring.
11. Verify the generated Excel workbook after implementation to ensure every tab contains the correct columns and ordering.
